- [Flux TTS overview](https://developers.deepgram.com/docs/flux-tts/overview.md), [voice agent patterns](https://developers.deepgram.com/docs/flux-tts/voice-agent.md), and [voice controls](https://developers.deepgram.com/docs/tts-voice-controls.md).
- [Pipecat docs index](https://docs.pipecat.ai/llms.txt): every Pipecat docs page.
- [Flux example in the Pipecat repo](https://github.com/pipecat-ai/pipecat/blob/main/examples/voice/voice-deepgram-flux.py).

## Trust, security, and data residency

- SOC 2 Type 1 and Type 2 certified, HIPAA compliant (BAAs for Enterprise), GDPR ready, CCPA compliant, and PCI compliant.
- Regional endpoints: global (`api.deepgram.com`), EU (`api.eu.deepgram.com`), India (`api.in.deepgram.com`), and Australia (`api.au.deepgram.com`). See [regional endpoints](https://developers.deepgram.com/reference/regional-endpoints.md) for the full list and per-region model availability.
- [Security policy](https://developers.deepgram.com/trust-security/security-policy.md), [data privacy compliance](https://developers.deepgram.com/trust-security/data-privacy-compliance.md), and [information security and privacy](https://developers.deepgram.com/trust-security/information-security-privacy.md).

## Company

- Founded in 2015. Raised a $130M Series C at a $1.3B valuation in January 2026, led by AVP. Acquired Daily, the makers of Pipecat, in 2026. Serves 5,000+ organizations.
- [About](https://deepgram.com/about), [newsroom](https://deepgram.com/company/newsroom), [careers](https://deepgram.com/careers), and [customer stories](https://deepgram.com/customers).
- [Partners](https://deepgram.com/partners), including IBM: Deepgram provides the voice capabilities in IBM watsonx Orchestrate.
- [Startup program](https://deepgram.com/startup-program): Credits and support for early-stage companies.

